{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:53:45+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-13T16:53:45+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Renishaw plc","sector":"Technology","industry":"Scientific & Technical Instruments","country":"United Kingdom","city":"Wotton-under-Edge","website":"https://www.renishaw.com","employees":5254,"summary":"Renishaw plc, an engineering and scientific technology company, designs, manufactures, distributes, sells, and services technological products and services, and analytical instruments and medical devices worldwide. The company operates through three segments: Industrial Metrology, Position Measurement, and Specialised Technologies. It offers precision measurement and process control products, such as co-ordinate measuring machine probes, software, retrofits, equator gauging systems, fixtures, machine calibration and optimization, machine tool probes, precision styli for metrology, and smart manufacturing data platform; and position and motion control products comprising interferometric laser, magnetic, and optical encoders. The company also provides healthcare products, such as neuromate stereotactic robots, neuroinfuse drug delivery systems, neuroinspire surgical planning software, dixi medical's, and Raman spectrometers; industrial robots; and metal additive 3D printing manufacturing systems. It serves the aerospace, automotive, consumer electronics, medical and healthcare, heavy, machine builder, energy, and precision manufacturing industries, as well as scientific, research, and analysis industries. The company was incorporated in 1973 and is based in Wotton-under-Edge, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"Renishaw plc, une société d'ingénierie et de technologie scientifique, conçoit, fabrique, distribue, vend et fournit des produits et services technologiques, ainsi que des instruments analytiques et des dispositifs médicaux dans le monde entier. La société opère à travers trois segments: métrologie industrielle, mesure de position et technologies spécialisées. Il offre des produits de mesure de précision et de contrôle de processus, tels que des sondes de machines de mesure coordonnées, des logiciels, des mises à niveau, des systèmes de jaugeage équatorial, des appareils, l'étalonnage et l'optimisation des machines, des sondes de machines-outils, des stylets de précision pour la métrologie et une plate-forme de données de fabrication intelligente; et des produits de contrôle de position et de mouvement comprenant des codeurs laser interférométriques, magnétiques et optiques."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":3544742912,"shares_outstanding":72757446,"trailing_pe":30.26087,"forward_pe":17.628286,"price_to_book":359.98227,"ev_to_ebitda":18.594,"ev_to_revenue":4.083,"dividend_yield":0.0163,"payout_ratio":0.4777,"beta_yahoo":1.024},"targets":{"current_price":4872.0,"mean":6372.5,"median":6185.0,"high":7750.0,"low":5350.0,"n_analysts":8,"reco_mean":1.77778,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-09-23"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-10-29","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.51568,"institutions_pct":0.39709,"institutions_float_pct":0.81988996,"institutions_n":162,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":266,"value":1295952,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.86010003}],"funds":[{"name":"T. ROWE PRICE Intl Fd.S, INC.-T. Rowe Price Intl Discovery Fd.","pct":0.0068,"shares":497192,"value":2422319424,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.025899999},{"name":"VANGUARD TRUSTEES' EQUITY FUND-Vanguard International Value Fund","pct":0.0068,"shares":492126,"value":2397637872,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.1408},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0067000003,"shares":489635,"value":2385501720,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0